---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import LastVerified from '../../components/LastVerified.astro';
import QuickAnswer from '../../components/QuickAnswer.astro';
import SourceList from '../../components/SourceList.astro';
import RelatedGuides from '../../components/RelatedGuides.astro';
import { sourceUrls } from '../../data/sources';

const title = 'DragonSword Awakening Price & Editions — Steam Buying Guide';
const description = 'Current DragonSword Awakening Steam price, Deluxe Pack, Deluxe Edition bundle, supported platform and official buying information checked August 13, 2026.';
const canonical = 'https://dragonswordguide.com/price/';
const article = { '@context': 'https://schema.org', '@type': 'Article', headline: title, description, mainEntityOfPage: canonical, datePublished: '2026-08-13', dateModified: '2026-08-13', publisher: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'DragonSword Guide' } };
const sources = [
  { label: 'Official Steam store page', href: sourceUrls.steam, note: 'Evidence B — current US listing, Windows platform, Deluxe bundle and included products.' },
  { label: 'Official Steam Deluxe Edition bundle', href: 'https://store.steampowered.com/bundle/77856/DragonSword__Awakening__Deluxe_Edition/', note: 'Evidence B — lists the base game plus Deluxe Pack and current US bundle price.' },
];
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} ogType="article" schema={[article]}>
  <div class="shell page-wrap"><Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'DragonSword Guide', href: '/' }, { label: 'Price & Editions' }]} /><article>
    <header class="article-header"><p class="eyebrow">Buying guide · Official Steam listing</p><h1>DragonSword Awakening Price & Editions</h1><LastVerified date="August 13, 2026" /></header>
    <QuickAnswer title="The current US Steam base price is $29.99."><p>DragonSword : Awakening is sold through Steam as a Windows PC game. Steam also lists a separate Deluxe Pack and a Deluxe Edition bundle. Prices vary by Steam region and can change, so use the official store link before purchasing.</p></QuickAnswer>
    <div class="article-body">
      <h2>Current Steam price</h2>
      <div class="price-table"><div class="price-row price-head"><strong>Edition or product</strong><strong>Current US listing</strong><strong>Last checked</strong></div><div class="price-row"><span>DragonSword : Awakening</span><strong>$29.99</strong><span>August 13, 2026</span></div><div class="price-row"><span>DragonSword : Awakening - Deluxe Pack</span><strong>$19.99</strong><span>August 13, 2026</span></div><div class="price-row"><span>DragonSword : Awakening - Deluxe Edition bundle</span><strong>$44.98</strong><span>August 13, 2026</span></div></div>
      <p class="note">The Deluxe Edition bundle page showed a 10% bundle discount: $49.98 for the individual products and $44.98 as the current bundle price when checked. Steam regional pricing, discounts and availability can vary.</p>
      <h2>What is included in the Deluxe Edition bundle?</h2><p>The official bundle lists two products: the base game, <em>DragonSword : Awakening</em>, and <em>DragonSword : Awakening - Deluxe Pack</em>. This page uses Steam's product name rather than inventing a separate edition name.</p>
      <h2>Where can you buy DragonSword Awakening?</h2><p>The official purchase channel verified for this guide is the <a href={sourceUrls.steam}>DragonSword : Awakening Steam store page</a>. The Steam listing identifies the Windows platform; no separate official store channel was used here.</p>
      <h2>Is DragonSword Awakening free-to-play?</h2><p>No. This is a premium purchase listing. For the deeper explanation of the removed gacha model, playable-content boundary and optional DLC, see <a href="/is-it-gacha/">Is DragonSword Awakening a Gacha?</a>.</p>
      <h2>Console buying status</h2><p>The official evidence checked for this page confirms the Windows Steam listing. It does not confirm a current PlayStation or Xbox purchase listing, release date or platform availability, so no console date is stated here.</p>
      <h2>Price FAQ</h2><h3>How much is DragonSword Awakening?</h3><p>The current US Steam listing checked on August 13, 2026 was $29.99 before any regional or temporary discount.</p><h3>Is there a Deluxe Edition?</h3><p>Steam lists a “DragonSword : Awakening - Deluxe Edition” bundle containing the base game and Deluxe Pack. The US bundle price checked was $44.98 after the displayed 10% bundle discount.</p><h3>Is DragonSword Awakening on Steam?</h3><p>Yes. The verified store listing is for Windows PC on Steam.</p><h3>Is it available on console?</h3><p>No current console listing was verified in the official sources used for this page.</p>
    </div><SourceList sources={sources} /><RelatedGuides links={[{ label: 'Is It Gacha?', href: '/is-it-gacha/' }, { label: 'Beginner Guide', href: '/guides/beginner/' }, { label: 'PC System Requirements', href: '/system-requirements/' }, { label: 'Roadmap', href: '/roadmap/' }]} />
  </article></div>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .page-wrap { padding: 1.25rem 0 2rem; } .article-header { max-width: 820px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; } .eyebrow { color: var(--accent-light); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; } h1, h2 { line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.04em; } h1 { font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 7vw, 5rem); margin: 0 0 .7rem; } h2 { font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem); margin: 2.5rem 0 .7rem; } h3 { margin-top: 1.5rem; } .article-body { max-width: 800px; } .article-body p { color: var(--muted-strong); } .price-table { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--paper); } .price-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(250px, 1.5fr) minmax(140px, .7fr) minmax(140px, .7fr); gap: 1rem; padding: .9rem 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); align-items: center; } .price-row:last-child { border-bottom: 0; } .price-head { color: var(--muted); background: var(--raised); font-size: .78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .04em; } .price-row strong { color: var(--accent-light); } .price-row span:last-child { color: var(--muted); font-size: .84rem; } .note { margin-top: .8rem; font-size: .9rem; } @media (max-width: 650px) { .price-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: .25rem; } .price-head { display: none; } }
</style>
